      "en": "Every man shall give as he is able, according to the LORD your God’s blessing which he has given you.",
      "ko": "각 사람이 네 하나님 여호와의 주신 복을 따라 그 힘대로 물건을 드릴찌니라",
      "source_text_hash": "e53295ae538d831ad62f2d7a30cf5fc72c01595a11e9deeb3bcb1c847c3cee6a",
      "translation_text_hash": "543bed56bc4dddb1e3d317a743dffcb96b5b79cccceb593847023fd885d5e321",
