      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "DEU",
          "chapter": 16,
          "verse": 18
        }
      ],
      "en": "You shall make judges and officers in all your gates, which the LORD your God gives you, according to your tribes; and they shall judge the people with righteous judgment.",
      "ko": "네 하나님 여호와께서 네게 주시는 각 성에서 네 지파를 따라 재판장과 유사를 둘것이요 그들은 공의로 백성을 재판할 것이니라",
      "source_text_hash": "2ddde842aef79c580758b88b672e8a090c1411417605fd0760ab955f450837de",
      "translation_text_hash": "2939900ffa79ac072a75ad92b18b0288ebfbc45fbe9e8655ccb28574013bd90a",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
